{"title":"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The product <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/321f1b2f502abcb26850595773ab98853a005c45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8\\times .25\\times 2\\times .125 =$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"159\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/2/ab2b27fe3f080bbb57ddd55067abff41f4295173.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\frac18 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\frac14 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\frac12 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"345\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Converting decimals to fractions yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/d/eed18e607282242c371874d22d0cdc96ff6da681.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\times .25 \\times 2 \\times .125 = \\frac{8}{1} \\times \\frac{1}{4} \\times \\frac{2}{1} \\times \\frac{1}{8} = \\frac{16}{32} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"415\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME\" title=\"1988 AJHSME\">1988 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Prob